      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/fried-chicken-broccoli-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season the chicken with salt and pepper. Once the pan is hot, add chicken to the pan and cook until golden brown - about 5 minutes per side.",
