      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-fried-chicken-and-broccoli/#wprm-recipe-53295-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/fried-chicken-broccoli-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the broccoli and remaining butter to the pan and sautee for a few more minutes. Season with additional salt and pepper if desired.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-fried-chicken-and-broccoli/#wprm-recipe-53295-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/fried-chicken-broccoli-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve in a small bowl with all of the pan drippings. Use the broccoli to soak up the pan drippings.",
